From: 2ed-code <2ed-code@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 11:10:00 +0000
Subject: Remove remaining Cromite-branded settings entry

Hide the inherited Cromite flags shortcut from the visible settings UI.
The underlying flags remain available through the normal Chromium flags
mechanism and no privacy or ad-blocking functionality is removed.

License: GPL-2.0-or-later - https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-2.0-or-later.html
---
 chrome/android/java/res/xml/privacy_preferences_cromite.xml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/chrome/android/java/res/xml/privacy_preferences_cromite.xml b/chrome/android/java/res/xml/privacy_preferences_cromite.xml
--- a/chrome/android/java/res/xml/privacy_preferences_cromite.xml
+++ b/chrome/android/java/res/xml/privacy_preferences_cromite.xml
@@ -111,6 +111,7 @@
     <org.chromium.chrome.browser.about_settings.HyperlinkPreference
         android:key="cromite_flags"
         android:title="@string/cromite_flags_title"
+        app:isPreferenceVisible="false"
         app:url="@string/cromite_flags_url" />
 
     <org.chromium.components.browser_ui.settings.ChromeSwitchPreference
--
